# Review CLIs for a lanes worker box (tools/lane-worker/install.sh), Linux
# and macOS, each unpacked into ~/.local/share/lane-worker/<tool>-<version>.
# Codex stays on the release lanes already use; its "codex-package" tarball carries the bundled
# bwrap its read-only sandbox needs. CodeRabbit's digests match the release's
# SHA256SUMS; its own install.sh is not used because it may edit shell
# profiles to put ~/.local/bin on PATH. jq is installed only where lanes find
# none; its digests match the release's sha256sum.txt. Codex digests match the
# GitHub release asset digests.
CODEX_VERSION=0.169.0
